        }
      }
    },
    "No naps logged recently.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geen dutjes recent gelogd."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%% of naps in the crate (%lld of %lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld%% van de dutjes in de bench (%2$lld van %3$lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Averaging %@h night sleep, %lld nap(s) today.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gemiddeld %1$@u nachtslaap, %2$lld dutje(s) vandaag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld walks this week, averaging %lld min.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld wandelingen deze week, gemiddeld %2$lld min."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld skills in progress, %lld sessions this week.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld vaardigheden bezig, %2$lld sessies deze week."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How's it going?": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoe gaat het?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick check-in helps us focus advice on what matters most.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een snelle check-in helpt ons advies te focussen op wat het belangrijkst is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Main focus": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoofdfocus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you most want help with?": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waar wil je het meeste hulp bij?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set as main focus": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stel in als hoofdfocus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear main focus": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wis hoofdfocus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Crate training helps with potty training - puppies naturally avoid soiling their den.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Benchtraining helpt bij zindelijkheidstraining - puppy's vermijden van nature hun hol te bevuilen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overtired puppies bite more. Getting enough sleep will reduce nipping.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vermoeide puppy's bijten meer. Genoeg slaap vermindert het bijten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The crate gives you a timeout option and ensures your pup gets enough rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De bench geeft je een time-out optie en zorgt dat je pup genoeg rust krijgt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Crate training builds comfort with alone time, which prevents separation anxiety.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Benchtraining bouwt comfort op met alleen zijn, wat verlatingsangst voorkomt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tired or bored puppies chew more. Enforcing naps helps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vermoeide of verveelde puppy's kauwen meer. Dutjes afdwingen helpt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you can't supervise, the crate prevents destructive chewing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als je niet kunt toezien, voorkomt de bench destructief kauwen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overtired puppies are more reactive. More sleep often means less barking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vermoeide puppy's zijn reactiever. Meer slaap betekent vaak minder blaffen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 1-minute rule": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De 1-minuut regel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puppies will settle if you can wait through about 1 minute of whining. Sit nearby so they know you're there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puppy's kalmeren als je ongeveer 1 minuut janken kunt afwachten. Zit dichtbij zodat ze weten dat je er bent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location matters": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Locatie is belangrijk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put the crate in a quiet corner of a social room - not isolated, but not in the middle of activity.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zet de bench in een rustig hoekje van een sociale ruimte - niet geïsoleerd, maar ook niet midden in de drukte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a cozy den": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Creëer een gezellig hol"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cover the crate with a blanket to create a den-like feeling. Leave one side open for airflow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bedek de bench met een deken voor een holgevoel. Laat één kant open voor ventilatie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never punish": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nooit straffen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The crate should always be positive. Never use it as punishment or your pup will resist going in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De bench moet altijd positief zijn. Gebruik het nooit als straf, anders gaat je pup tegenstribbelen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why crate training matters": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waarom benchtraining belangrijk is"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It helps with potty training, prevents destructive behavior, and gives your pup a safe space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het helpt bij zindelijkheidstraining, voorkomt destructief gedrag en geeft je pup een veilige plek."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timing is everything": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Timing is alles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take your puppy out immediately after waking, eating, playing, and every 1-2 hours while awake.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neem je pup direct naar buiten na het wakker worden, eten, spelen, en elke 1-2 uur als die wakker is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the crate": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gebruik de bench"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puppies naturally avoid soiling where they sleep. The crate makes potty training much easier.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puppy's vermijden van nature hun slaapplaats te bevuilen. De bench maakt zindelijkheidstraining veel makkelijker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't punish accidents": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Straf ongelukjes niet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clean up calmly without scolding. Punishment creates fear, not learning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ruim rustig op zonder te schelden. Straffen creëert angst, geen leren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Celebrate outside!": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vier het buiten!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give treats and praise immediately when your puppy goes outside. Make it a party!": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geef direct snoepjes en lof als je pup buiten gaat. Maak er een feestje van!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "18-20 hours daily": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "18-20 uur per dag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puppies need 18-20 hours of sleep per day. If yours isn't sleeping this much, enforce more naps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puppy's hebben 18-20 uur slaap per dag nodig. Als die van jou niet zoveel slaapt, dwing meer dutjes af."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enforce naps": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dwing dutjes af"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puppies don't know when they're tired. After 1-2 hours awake, put them in the crate for a nap.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puppy's weten niet wanneer ze moe zijn. Na 1-2 uur wakker zijn, doe ze in de bench voor een dutje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch for overtired signs": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let op signalen van oververmoeidheid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Biting, zoomies, not listening, and being generally 'difficult' often means your pup needs sleep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bijten, zoomies, niet luisteren en algemeen 'moeilijk' zijn betekent vaak dat je pup slaap nodig heeft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sleep prevents biting": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Slaap voorkomt bijten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Most nipping happens when puppies are overtired. A well-rested pup bites much less.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De meeste bijtincidenten gebeuren als puppy's oververmoeid zijn. Een uitgeruste pup bijt veel minder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use timeouts": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gebruik time-outs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When biting gets intense, calmly put your pup in the crate for a few minutes to settle down.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als het bijten intens wordt, doe je pup rustig in de bench voor een paar minuten om te kalmeren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Redirect to toys": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leid af naar speelgoed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always have a toy nearby to redirect biting. Praise when they bite the toy instead of you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heb altijd speelgoed in de buurt om bijten om te leiden. Prijs als ze in het speelgoed bijten in plaats van jou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's normal (but temporary)": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het is normaal (maar tijdelijk)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All puppies go through a nippy phase. With consistent management, it peaks around 12-16 weeks then fades.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle puppy's gaan door een bijtfase. Met consistent management piekt het rond 12-16 weken en verdwijnt dan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Train before meals": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Train voor maaltijden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A hungry puppy is a motivated puppy. Schedule training sessions before meal times.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een hongerige pup is een gemotiveerde pup. Plan trainingssessies voor de maaltijden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep it short": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Houd het kort"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5-10 minute sessions work best. End on a win and your pup will be eager for next time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessies van 5-10 minuten werken het beste. Eindig met een succes en je pup kijkt uit naar de volgende keer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use kibble for training": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gebruik brokjes voor training"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If training isn't working, try switching to kibble as treats. Fresh food can make them picky.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als training niet werkt, probeer brokjes als beloning. Vers eten kan ze kieskeurig maken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boredom causes chewing": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verveling veroorzaakt kauwen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puppies chew when bored or understimulated. Provide appropriate chew toys and puzzles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puppy's kauwen als ze zich vervelen. Zorg voor geschikt kauwspeelgoed en puzzels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teething relief": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verlichting bij tanden wisselen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frozen washcloths and frozen Kongs help soothe teething gums and redirect chewing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bevroren washandjes en bevroren Kongs verzachten tandvlees en leiden kauwen om."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Crate builds confidence": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bench bouwt zelfvertrouwen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regular crate time teaches your pup that being alone is okay. Start with short periods.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regelmatige benchtijd leert je pup dat alleen zijn oké is. Begin met korte periodes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start small": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Begin klein"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave the room for just seconds at first, then gradually increase. Build up to longer absences.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verlaat de kamer eerst voor seconden, verhoog dan geleidelijk. Bouw op naar langere afwezigheid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check sleep first": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check eerst slaap"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overtired puppies are more reactive and bark more. More naps often means less barking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vermoeide puppy's zijn reactiever en blaffen meer. Meer dutjes betekent vaak minder blaffen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Acknowledge, then redirect": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erken, dan omleiden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank your pup for alerting you, then redirect with a 'quiet' cue or toy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bedank je pup voor het waarschuwen, leid dan om met een 'stil' commando of speelgoed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Four on the floor": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vier poten op de grond"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only give attention when all four paws are on the ground. Reward sitting automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geef alleen aandacht als alle vier de poten op de grond staan. Beloon automatisch zitten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn away": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Draai je om"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When your pup jumps, turn away and ignore. Attention - even negative - rewards jumping.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als je pup springt, draai je om en negeer. Aandacht - zelfs negatief - beloont springen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Be interesting": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wees interessant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your pup pulls toward distractions, become more interesting! Use treats and engagement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als je pup naar afleidingen trekt, word interessanter! Gebruik snoepjes en betrokkenheid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop and wait": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop en wacht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the leash goes tight, stop moving. Only walk again when there's slack. Consistency is key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als de riem strak komt, stop met bewegen. Loop pas weer als er slack is. Consistentie is de sleutel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn more": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meer leren"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
